<title>AUSTRALIA: Rugby league-Manly win Australian grand final.</title>
<headline>Rugby league-Manly win Australian grand final.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the Australian rugby league grand final played at the Sydney Football Stadium on Sunday:</p>
<p> Manly  20  St George   8</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
